{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1752788810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras_big/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1752788810 width=800 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1752788810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras_big/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1752788810 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1752788810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras_big/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1752788810 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540870?t=1752788810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/91ed516099bffe7898cc723244429bbe8c4d0b58/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752788810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/bbeda0cc113b9a030b6a814da2880258fbcab0ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752788810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/bbeda0cc113b9a030b6a814da2880258fbcab0ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752788810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features pretty descriptive mentions of murder and its method, whilst nothing is graphically shown descriptions are detailed"},"demos":[{"appid":3875280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1752788810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras_big/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1752788810 width=800 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1752788810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras_big/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1752788810 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1752788810\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras_big/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1752788810 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Rambi_PorkChop"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/header.jpg?t=1752788810","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3540870/830382/160d1ba66f6395d869810fa0f197725570bd8fd0/1750859512/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742131658","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3540870/830382/160d1ba66f6395d869810fa0f197725570bd8fd0/1750859512/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742131658","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3540870/830382/160d1ba66f6395d869810fa0f197725570bd8fd0/1750859512/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742131658","id":257099232,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099232/movie480.mp4?t=1742131658","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099232/movie_max.mp4?t=1742131658"},"name":"You are a Failed Murder Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099232/0a38519d7beef1626880d7030fb8ae5fb7f8e5d3/movie_600x3